{"unit_id":"VegeFin__Evolving-Werewolf#feature-1","repo":"VegeFin/Evolving-Werewolf","commit":"ff6c48286304f661b7daa54b17677ec2ad5b5a33","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"werewolf-engine 的功能「夜间角色行动」：狼人提交击杀目标，预言家查验存活玩家，女巫使用药剂，猎人可在出局时开枪；引擎按阶段校验并推进行动。 通过游戏阶段行动、浏览器面板或主持人知识工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1068"]}
{"unit_id":"VegeFin__Evolving-Werewolf#feature-2","repo":"VegeFin/Evolving-Werewolf","commit":"ff6c48286304f661b7daa54b17677ec2ad5b5a33","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"werewolf-engine 的功能「警长选举与白天投票」：玩家可参与竞选、退水和警长投票；随后按顺序发言并投票，平票时进入候选人重投流程。 通过游戏阶段行动、浏览器面板或主持人知识工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1210"]}
{"unit_id":"VegeFin__Evolving-Werewolf#feature-3","repo":"VegeFin/Evolving-Werewolf","commit":"ff6c48286304f661b7daa54b17677ec2ad5b5a33","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"werewolf-engine 的功能「人类浏览器席位」：开局可随机或指定人类座位，面板显示身份、局势和轮到自己的操作，并向游戏 API 提交行动。 通过游戏阶段行动、浏览器面板或主持人知识工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1391","ui/panel.html:483"]}
{"unit_id":"VegeFin__Evolving-Werewolf#feature-4","repo":"VegeFin/Evolving-Werewolf","commit":"ff6c48286304f661b7daa54b17677ec2ad5b5a33","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"werewolf-engine 的功能「跨局策略知识」：主持人可按角色分区查看和记录复盘知识；后续对局向玩家提供摘要及有限次数的知识详情。 通过游戏阶段行动、浏览器面板或主持人知识工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:164"]}
{"unit_id":"VegeFin__Evolving-Werewolf#feature-5","repo":"VegeFin/Evolving-Werewolf","commit":"ff6c48286304f661b7daa54b17677ec2ad5b5a33","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"werewolf-engine 的功能「图片素材工具」：提供读图、生成图片和素材状态工具；素材管线使用配置中的图像服务端点。 通过游戏阶段行动、浏览器面板或主持人知识工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1794"]}
{"unit_id":"VegeFin__Evolving-Werewolf#caveat-1","repo":"VegeFin/Evolving-Werewolf","commit":"ff6c48286304f661b7daa54b17677ec2ad5b5a33","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"werewolf-engine 的读图和生图工具会调用 open.bigmodel.cn；这是可选素材管线，基础游戏不依赖该服务。 (见 lib/index.js:1794-1799)","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1794","lib/index.js:1831"]}
